    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "1.197 OL08-00-020330"
      info        : "OL 8 must not allow accounts configured with blank or null passwords.

GROUP ID: V-248714
RULE ID: SV-248714r991589

If an account has an empty password, anyone could log on and run commands with the privileges of that account. Accounts with empty passwords should never be used in operational environments."
      solution    : "Edit the following line in \"etc/ssh/sshd_config\" to prevent logons with empty passwords.

PermitEmptyPasswords no

The SSH daemon must be restarted for the changes to take effect. To restart the SSH daemon, run the following command:

$ sudo systemctl restart sshd.service"
      reference   : "800-171|3.4.2,800-171r3|03.04.02a.,800-53|CM-6b.,800-53r5|CM-6b.,CAT|I,CCI|CCI-000366,CN-L3|8.1.10.6(d),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF2.0|DE.CM-09,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.9,ITSG-33|CM-6b.,LEVEL|1M,NESA|T3.2.1,Rule-ID|SV-248714r991589_rule,STIG-ID|OL08-00-020330,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-248714"
      see_also    : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/23791"
      cmd         : "/sbin/sshd -T | /bin/grep -i PermitEmptyPasswords"
      expect      : "(?i)[\\s]*PermitEmptyPasswords[\\s]+\"?no\"?[\\s]*$"
    </custom_item>

    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK_NOT
      description : "1.198 OL08-00-020331"
      info        : "OL 8 must not allow blank or null passwords in the system-auth file.

GROUP ID: V-248715RULE ID: SV-248715r991589

If an account has an empty password, anyone could log on and run commands with the privileges of that account. Accounts with empty passwords should never be used in operational environments."
      solution    : "Remove any instances of the \"nullok\" option in the \"/etc/pam.d/system-auth\" file to prevent logons with empty passwords.

Note: Manual changes to the listed file may be overwritten by the \"authselect\" program."
      reference   : "800-171|3.4.2,800-171r3|03.04.02a.,800-53|CM-6b.,800-53r5|CM-6b.,CAT|I,CCI|CCI-000366,CN-L3|8.1.10.6(d),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF2.0|DE.CM-09,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.9,ITSG-33|CM-6b.,LEVEL|1M,NESA|T3.2.1,Rule-ID|SV-248715r991589_rule,STIG-ID|OL08-00-020331,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-248715"
      see_also    : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/23791"
      file        : "/etc/pam.d/system-auth"
      regex       : "(?i)nullok"
      expect      : "(?i)^[^#]*nullok"
    </custom_item>

